{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"指数对象"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"指数对象"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中, 对象 $X$ 的 $Y$ 次<strong>指数对象</strong> (exponential object) 是 $Y$ 上的 $X$ 常值族的"},{"Local":{"url":"依值积","text":"依值积"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nX^Y = \\prod_{y\\colon Y} X = Y_*Y^*X.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>由定义及三元"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":" $Y_!\\dashv Y^* \\dashv Y_*$,\n$$\r\n(Y\\times -) = Y_!Y^* \\dashv Y_*Y^* = (-)^Y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>取值映射</h3>\n<p>对任意对象 $X,Y$, 称伴随 $(Y\\times -)\\dashv (-)^Y$ 的余单位\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ev}\\colon Y\\times X^Y \\to X\r\n$$\n为<strong>取值映射</strong> (evaluation map).</p>\n<h3>函子性</h3>\n<p>设有态射 $W\\to Y$, 则有\n$$\r\nW\\times X^Y \\to Y\\times X^Y\\overset{\\operatorname{ev}}{\\to}X,\r\n$$\n从而得自然变换\n$$\r\nX^Y\\to X^W.\r\n$$\n这说明有函子\n$$\r\nX^{(-)} \\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal C.\r\n$$\n在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的内语言","text":"内语言"}},{"Plain":"中这就是"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Hom}(-,X)$.</p>\n<h3>内蕴复合</h3>\n<p>迭代取值映射可得\n$$\r\nZ\\times Y^Z \\times X^Y \\to Y\\times X^Y \\to X,\r\n$$\n从而指数对象之间有自然变换\n$$\r\n(-\\circ -)\\colon Y^Z \\times X^Y \\to X^Z.\r\n$$\n在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的内语言","text":"内语言"}},{"Plain":"中这就是映射的复合.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}